            "review_title": "Review at Wink Lounge",
            "review_text": "ingrid6158\nBrisbane, Australia5 contributions\n0\nGood food and service\nOct 2015 • Couples\nWe stumbled in this restaurant by accident, we arrived in Hanoi late at night and wanted some dinner before retiring but did not want street food, they were still open so we asked if we could come in and eat. There was no issue with time, we were promptly served and the food was great, so we returned there for dinner again while in Hanoi.\nThe place is clean and has a nice atmosphere and décor with indoor and outdoor garden seating;plus you have a choice between Asian and western food as well as good cocktails.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 30, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
